Notebook[{
Cell["\<\
When stimulus is present at a time, the observation at the time is drawn from \
N(o; \[Mu],1). If it\[CloseCurlyQuote]s absent at a time, \
it\[CloseCurlyQuote]s drawn from N(o; 0,1).
Let pi be the prior probability of stimulus being in time i.
Let rij be reward of licking in time i when stimulus was in time j.
If o1 > \[Eta]1 we say stimulus in 1.
If o2 > \[Eta]2 we say stimulus in 2.
Can constrain \[Mu] to be > 0. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9088137100110197`*^9, 3.908813935842352*^9}, {
   3.908814078144105*^9, 3.908814103618381*^9}, {3.9088141922605352`*^9, 
   3.90881423131418*^9}, {3.9088143167359*^9, 3.908814409534336*^9}, {
   3.9088150913240967`*^9, 3.908815096569417*^9}, {3.908816393028627*^9, 
   3.908816402796625*^9}, {3.908816466642523*^9, 3.908816471567498*^9}, {
   3.909161324161105*^9, 3.90916132610991*^9}, 3.910178767134948*^9, {
   3.910787658419421*^9, 3.910787742662984*^9}, {3.910787921964246*^9, 
   3.91078799054607*^9}, {3.9107886698113613`*^9, 
   3.910788678043447*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"417f15ad-a794-45a1-9e02-\
49912f0612e8"],

