Cell["\<\
p3 = 0, p2 = 1 - p1; Assuming stimulus occurs at least once.
r11 = r22 = h; h > 0
r12 = r21 = - f; f > 0
r31 = r32 = 0; no cost for missing\
\>", "Text",
